.TH TWIST 1 2026-10-17 "Twist 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
twist \- A sample GNU program
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B twist
[\fIOPTION\fR]... [\fIFILE\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
twist is a sample program that follows GNU conventions.  It processes
files (or standard input if no files are specified) and displays
their contents with additional information.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B twist file.txt
Process file.txt and display its contents.
.TP
.B twist \-v
Show version information.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
Report bugs to <chris@localhost>.
